WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.800
-Welcome, everybody,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.636
welcome, welcome, welcome

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.070
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.639
You're here.
I love you!

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.374
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.276
Ah, feels great.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.245
Thank you so much.
Let's get to the news.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.946
Well, guys,
people are still talking

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:16.816
about President Biden's
first press conference

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.551
and, by all accounts,
he did well

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:20.252
and there were no major issues.

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:21.521
And, by "no major issues,"

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.890
I mean, his dog Major
didn't eat anyone's face.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.391
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:27.326
One of the big moments
from the press conference was

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:31.731
when Biden said he expects
to run for reelection in 2024.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.032
Kamala Harris was like,

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.767
"First he puts me in charge
of the border crisis.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.202
Now, this?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.438
Hell of a week."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.039
Listen, I'm not picking sides,
or anything,

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:42.408
but if it's eight years
of falling up airplane stairs

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.076
and dog attacks, sign me up!

00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:46.079
[ Laughter and cheering ]
Let's do it!

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:49.048
[ Applause ]

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.217
Meanwhile, Fox News is upset

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.486
because Biden didn't call
on them for a question.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.455
-Oh.
-They're so hurt,

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.990
this morning,
they did a show called...

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:02.895
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.931
That's right, Fox is mad
that they were left out.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.966
It's kind of like your bully
being offended

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.801
that he's not invited
to your birthday party.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.002
[ Laughter ]
It's like,

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.871
"But I just give you
a wedgie this morning."

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.673
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.942
But Fox News had a lot of very
fair questions ready to go.

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:18.011
Questions like, "Sir,

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.579
how long have you been
a lizard person?"

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.580
Stuff like that.
-Oh.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.015
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:24.183
Well --
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.152
-Illuminati joke, yeah.
-Wow. Wow.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.487
-Yeah.

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.788
Well, here's some big tech news.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.591
Yesterday, Georgia Republicans
built a time machine

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.459
back to 1875.

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:34.727
Check out their new law.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:35.995 line:0%
-The bill signed last night

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.597 line:0%
by Republican
Governor Brian Kemp

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:38.831 line:0%
is seen by critics

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:41.200 line:0%
as a collection
of voter suppression tactics.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.370 line:0%
The new law goes so far
as to bar volunteers

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.338 line:0%
from passing out water
and snacks

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:50.510 line:0%
to voters standing in lines,
lines which are much more likely

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.312 line:0%
to be longer
in Black neighborhoods.

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:56.415
[ Booing ]

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:59.118
-Yeah, the state of Georgia
just passed a new law

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:02.355
that restricts voting, so let's
just say the law is so racist,

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.657
it already has its own
warning label on Disney+.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:07.493
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:09.729
When you heard about the law,
Vladimir Putin was like --

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.197
[ As Putin ]
I'm so proud.
They learn

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:12.898
to rig their own elections.

00:02:12.898 --> 00:02:15.001
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.971
Teach a man to rig,
he will rig for a lifetime.

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.638
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:21.674
A lot of people are pointing out
how Georgia's governor

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.442
signed the bill into law
while he was surrounded

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:24.577
by other white guys.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:25.812
Take a look at this.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.813
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:29.449
They're basically set up
like bowling pins

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:31.083
for Stacey Abrams to knock down.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:35.054
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.489
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.757
[ Cymbals crash ]

00:02:38.757 --> 00:02:39.992
That looks like
if the Proud Boys

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:42.028
had a 50-year reunion,
doesn't it?

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.663
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.164
Well, guys, the giant cargo ship

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:47.767
is still stuck in the Suez Canal
-Oh.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.203
-Wow.
-and, every hour, it's delaying

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:53.573
about $400 million worth
of goods.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.308
You know, the captain's
friends are still like,

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.476
"No, honestly,
it's not even that bad.

00:02:57.476 --> 00:02:58.745
People aren't really
talking about it.

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:00.613
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.447
Just stay off the Internet.

00:03:02.447 --> 00:03:03.950
Just stay off Twitter.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.252
In fact, stay off of everything
but this phone call, yeah.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.686
No one's really talking
about it."

00:03:07.686 --> 00:03:09.889
Meanwhile, every 15 minutes,
the captain's wife is like,

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.723
"I told you to get off
at exit 34."

00:03:11.723 --> 00:03:13.026
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.927
You can't fit.
You can't fit in the thing.

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:16.763
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:19.465
First, they tried freeing
the ship with a bulldozer.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.134
Can we take a look
at that picture again?

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:25.571
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:29.976
Now, they're saying
up to 706,000 cubic feet of sand

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.445
will have to be removed
to free the ship.

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.080
But don't worry,
this kid's on it,

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.248
so it's going to be perfect.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:37.049
[ Laughter and applause ]
We got it.

00:03:37.049 --> 00:03:38.951
Hey, listen to this.
A Spirit Airlines flight

00:03:38.951 --> 00:03:41.020
from Cleveland to Los Angeles
was diverted

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.488
after a passenger tried

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:46.258
to open the emergency
exit door mid-flight.

00:03:46.258 --> 00:03:47.527
Don't worry, everyone is fine.

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.194
Thankfully,
Spirit always makes sure

00:03:49.194 --> 00:03:50.997
their doors are
Flex Sealed shut.

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:53.799
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:56.401
Listen, things like this
are going to happen

00:03:56.401 --> 00:03:58.070
when the in-flight movie
is "Mank."

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.605
-Yeah.
-Ohh.

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:01.640
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.976
-"I'll take 'Scoob!,'
whatever you got."

00:04:03.976 --> 00:04:05.178
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:06.812
Get this --
there was a mystery light show

00:04:06.812 --> 00:04:08.648
in the Pacific Northwest
last night

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:10.183
and it turned out to be caused
by something

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.051
pretty unexpected.
Check it out.

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.687 line:0%
-At around 9:00,
folks from Seattle to Portland

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:18.791 line:0%
reported brilliant
blazing streaks overhead.

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:20.893 line:0%
It turns out they were objects

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:26.099 line:0%
of debris from a SpaceX rocket
launched a few weeks ago.

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:27.266
-Phew!

00:04:27.266 --> 00:04:29.335
It's just careening,
fiery space debris.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:31.136
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.136 --> 00:04:32.305
For a second, I was nervous.
-Yeah.

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:33.673
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:35.207
And, finally,
some news from Canada.

00:04:35.207 --> 00:04:38.111
A police officer pulled someone
over after noticing something

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.045
that didn't look quite right.
Watch this.

00:04:40.045 --> 00:04:41.714 line:0%
-Police in Ontario
said an officer

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:45.017 line:0%
pulled over a motorcyclist
whose license plate was homemade

00:04:45.017 --> 00:04:46.753 line:0%
and also misspelled.

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:48.354
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:49.821
When they took him to jail,
the police were like,

00:04:49.821 --> 00:04:51.891
"It's a good thing you like
making license plates."

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.859
-Aw.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.859 --> 00:04:55.494
-At first, he tried
to bribe the police

00:04:55.494 --> 00:04:57.864
by handing them a Post-it note
that said "$20" on it.

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:59.232
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:00.933
Then it got even worse
when he handed the officer

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.536
his driver's license.
Look. There you go.

